WEBVTT

00:00:29.732 --> 00:00:31.362
Here, I'll give you an example.

00:00:32.263 --> 00:00:35.667
So I imagine my life
if, a hundred years ago,

00:00:35.691 --> 00:00:38.541
China had been the most powerful
nation in the world

00:00:38.565 --> 00:00:42.052
and they came to the United States
in search of coal.

00:00:42.076 --> 00:00:45.267
And they found it, and, in fact,
they found lots of it right here.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:48.817
And pretty soon,
they began shipping that coal,

00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:50.617
ton by ton,

00:00:50.641 --> 00:00:54.079
railcar by railcar, boatload by boatload,

00:00:54.103 --> 00:00:57.188
back to China and elsewhere
around the world.

00:00:58.069 --> 00:01:00.319
And they got fabulously
wealthy in doing so.